    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>In Power BI Embedded, we added more data source connections that can be updated through the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/mt814715.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Update Datasources</a> API:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>OData feed</li>\r\n <li>SharePoint Online</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/power-bi/desktop-data-sources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about data sources in Power BI</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "In Power BI Embedded, we added more data source connections that can be updated through the Update Datasources API:\n\nOData feed\n\nSharePoint Online\n\nLearn more about data sources in Power BI ."
  },
